       01  DFHVALUE-IMMEDIATE      PIC S9(08) COMP VALUE 1.
       01  DFHVALUE-DELETE         PIC S9(08) COMP VALUE 4.
       01  DFHVALUE-POST           PIC S9(08) COMP VALUE 2.
       01  DFHVALUE-PUT            PIC S9(08) COMP VALUE 3.
       01  DFHVALUE-SRVCONVERT     PIC S9(08) COMP VALUE 1.
       01  DFHVALUE-NOSRVCONVERT   PIC S9(08) COMP VALUE 0.
       01  DFHVALUE-CLICONVERT     PIC S9(08) COMP VALUE 1.
       01  DFHVALUE-NOCLICONVERT   PIC S9(08) COMP VALUE 0.
